{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-qq-remote#feature-1","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-qq-remote","commit":"b724335a194d217f51dedbfd799d02ae67559d3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-remote 的功能「QQ 派发任务与进度查看」：在私聊中发送普通文本或使用 /ask，可将任务交给目标 DSH agent；/status 和 /progress 可查询状态及近期进度。群聊消息需带配置的命令前缀。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/commands.js:31-59","lib/commands.js:145-172"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-qq-remote#feature-2","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-qq-remote","commit":"b724335a194d217f51dedbfd799d02ae67559d3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-remote 的功能「会话管理」：通过 /sessions 列出会话，使用 /session 按序号、标题或 ID 切换目标，并用 /title 重命名或 /newsession 新建会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/commands.js:116-143"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-qq-remote#feature-3","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-qq-remote","commit":"b724335a194d217f51dedbfd799d02ae67559d3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-remote 的功能「远程命令与截图」：私聊发送 /exec 可在配置工作目录运行 shell 命令并回传输出；/screenshot 会采集屏幕并以图片发回 QQ。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/commands.js:157-177"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-qq-remote#feature-4","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-qq-remote","commit":"b724335a194d217f51dedbfd799d02ae67559d3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-remote 的功能「持久化聊天」：启用 /chat 后，私聊消息交由 DSH 当前默认模型生成回复，并将多轮消息按聊天会话保存到本机；还可将指定 DSH 会话绑定为聊天模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/chat.js:85-115","lib/chat.js:118-212"]}
{"unit_id":"ASAKAFENG__dsh-qq-remote#caveat-1","repo":"ASAKAFENG/dsh-qq-remote","commit":"b724335a194d217f51dedbfd799d02ae67559d3b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-remote 使用前须知：必须先运行兼容 OneBot 11 的 QQ 桥接服务；插件默认连接本机 ws://127.0.0.1:3001/ws，且聊天记忆写入 ~/.dsh/qq-remote-chats/。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-45","lib/chat.js:9-16","lib/chat.js:34-39"]}
